      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I verify that a Chittoor mover is IBA approved and ISO certified?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Check the mover’s official website or request a copy of the IBA approval certificate and ISO 9001:2015 audit report. Authentic providers display the certification numbers, which you can cross‑verify on the IBA portal or ISO registry. This ensures compliance with national relocation standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the cost of house shifting in Chittoor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing depends on total volume, distance (Chittoor to the destination hub), vehicle type, floor‑level access, and any special handling like fragile or antique items. Additional services such as packing, insurance, and temporary storage also affect the final tariff.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the 100% insurance offered by Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers applicable to all items?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The comprehensive insurance covers declared value up to the policy limit for all packed goods, including furniture, electronics, and personal effects. High‑value items like jewelry or artwork should be declared separately to ensure full reimbursement in case of loss or damage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it moves from Chittoor to a major hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every Shree Ashirwad truck is equipped with satellite GPS that provides real‑time location updates through a secure client portal. You receive instant alerts at key checkpoints, ensuring transparency throughout the 850 km transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for a smooth inter‑city move from Chittoor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid ID proof, address proof, the e‑Way bill generated for the cargo, and a signed service agreement. For corporate or government relocations, additional reimbursement forms may be required, all of which are prepared by the mover’s support team.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging system protect delicate items during a Chittoor move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, stretch film for weather resistance, and custom wooden crates for glass or temple items. Each layer absorbs shocks, preventing breakage during long‑haul transport.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees I should watch out for when hiring packers and movers in Chittoor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transparent providers like Shree Ashirwad disclose all charges upfront, including fuel surcharge, tolls, and optional services. Hidden fees typically arise from last‑minute changes, extra stair carries, or undeclared heavy items. Clarify the scope before signing the contract to avoid surprises.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
